sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant App as Xposter
  participant Auth as Action token helper
  participant Ntfy as ntfy.sh
  participant Phone as iPhone ntfy app
  participant API as Express API

  App->>Auth: createActionToken("approve", postId)
  Auth-->>App: exp.signature
  App->>Ntfy: Publish notification with view action URL
  Ntfy-->>Phone: Display Approve / Skip buttons
  Phone->>API: Open signed URL in browser
  API->>Auth: verifyActionToken(action, postId, token)
  Auth-->>API: valid or invalid
  API-->>Phone: Confirmation or unauthorized page
